er  there is no way  that anyone who makes it to the last two  should either offer or accept a  compromise that goes behind the backs of  conservative party members  now you asked about the panorama story  i'm afraid i only heard a little bit of  it on the radio this morning so  let me answer  what i know  i know  that between 2005 and 2009  when i was serving in afghanistan  i met many extraordinary courageous  determined and brave people serving our  country  i know  that during my time in afghanistan i  neither saw nor heard any of these  accusations  and i know  that any investigation any accusation  will be investigated fully by the  ministry of defense  and that's not just because it's the  right thing to do  for the victims or potential victims or  alleged victims it's the right thing to  do for the british military  because we stand on our values and  standards as a country and the military  especially  is absolutely reliant on those values of  standards to maintain the ethos  and discipline in war that is essential  to victory  so i have absolutely no doubt that if  there is any truth  to these accusations  then the mod will sort it out  sam coats  mr teagan hat um first of all you just  talked about the need for an election  how soon would do you think there should  be an election are you talking about  cutting short this parliament down the  road in another leadership uh uh contest  launch it's incredible to believe that  there's more than one at the moment  dominick roberts just said that this is  no time to learn on the job he's right  isn't he and finally you opened your  speech by talking about britishness  we've also talked about being a dual  national you have a french mother what  have you learned uh from that by being a  jude nation sure well i think the first  thing i've learned uh about being a dual  national is that i should have chosen my  mother better  when i decided  to go into politics  there's only so many things i can change  sam that's 