s determined  to deliver for all of our homes our  communities our families  of course you are  the reason my colleagues  stood as conservative members of  parliament the reason we are lucky to  have such extraordinary talent in our  party  at westminster and in council chambers  across the country the reason that the  conservative party is the natural party  of government is because we are a party  that prioritizes service and delivery  and that is exactly what we will do  when i am leader we will get back to  serving the british people and make sure  that the leadership of the party serves  the membership to deliver the values  that we all share  that's how i'm going to be prime  minister here  well as i say there are many differences  he had to pay a lot of money to hand  over his citizenship i'm not allowed to  give up mine  [Applause]  okay

